# skill-frontmatter: frontmatter with the folder's name and a description
spec: Finders
args: agent-files skill-frontmatter
-- .agents/skills/good/SKILL.md --
---
name: good
description: Does a thing. Use when the thing is needed.
---
-- .agents/skills/bare/SKILL.md --
# No frontmatter
-- .agents/skills/renamed/SKILL.md --
---
name: other
---
-- @stdout --
.agents/skills/bare/SKILL.md:1:1: no --- frontmatter
.agents/skills/renamed/SKILL.md:2:1: name other isn't the folder's, renamed
.agents/skills/renamed/SKILL.md:1:1: no description
